{"corpus":"ccc","number":2130,"text_html":"<span>Cependant dès l’Ancien Testament, Dieu a ordonné ou permis l’institution d’images qui conduiraient symboliquement au salut par le Verbe incarné : ainsi le serpent d’airain <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"1\">1</sup>, l’arche d’Alliance et les chérubins <sup class=\"srcRef bibleRef\" data-idx=\"4\">2</sup>.</span>","cross_refs":[],"bible_refs":[{"text":"Nb 21:4-9"},{"text":"Sg 16:5-14"},{"text":"Jn 3:14-15"},{"text":"Ex 25:10-22"},{"text":"1 R 6:23-28"},{"text":"1 R 7:23-26"}],"citations":[],"magisterial_refs":[{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Nb 21:4-9","idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Sg 16:5-14","idx":2,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"Jn 3:14-15","idx":3,"marker_idx":1,"display_idx":1},{"type":"bible","raw":"voir Ex 25:10-22","idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible","raw":"1 R 6:23-28","idx":5,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":2},{"type":"bible_continuation","raw":"7:23-26","idx":6,"marker_idx":4,"display_idx":2}]}